  "body": "- Local access to walking trails to Long Bay Beach and Long Bay Regional Park\r\n- Downstairs bedroom with en-suite and lounge access\r\n- Designer floor-to-ceiling tiled bathrooms with feature lighting\r\n- Master suite with bush views, walk-in wardrobe, and en-suite (bath + shower)\r\n- Additional upstairs lounge\r\n\r\nStep into a private sanctuary where luxury living meets nature's tranquillity. This exceptional residence offers a rare lifestyle opportunity-combining refined interiors with seamless access to the natural beauty of Long Bay Regional Park and the sparkling ocean. Designed for both relaxed family living and elegant entertaining, every detail of this home has been thoughtfully curated to deliver comfort, space, and sophistication.\r\n\r\nOther Features Include:\r\n- Family lounge downstairs with fireplace\r\n- Open-plan kitchen/dining flowing to large private deck\r\n- Pergola-covered deck with spa potential\r\n- Modern kitchen with built-in fridge/freezer, gas hob and Miele appliances\r\n- Butler's pantry with additional gas hob\r\n- Double internal garage + ample off-street parking (boat/caravan/motorhome)\r\n- Landscaped garden with lower deck and shed\r\n- Kayak Storage Enclosure\r\n\r\nPositioned in a family-friendly, community-focused pocket of North Shores' Long Bay, this home is perfectly located to enjoy the very best of coastal living. You'll be in zone for top local schools including Long Bay College, Long Bay Primary School, and Northcross Intermediate. Everyday convenience is at your fingertips with nearby amenities such as BestStart Kindergarten, New World, the iconic Long Bay Surf Club, and popular local favourite November Eatery, along with many more. With an abundance of walking tracks, access to Long Bay Beach, and the surrounding regional park, this is a lifestyle opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/SPFS",
